# Domain 6.2A: Scandit runtime is generated by prebuild (scandit:prepare) from the pinned
# packages and verified by scandit:verify-dist. Never commit it.
public/scandit/

# Domain 6.2C: the policy manifest is generated by scandit:policy:manifest and
# retained as a certification artifact of the pipeline that produced it. It is
# never committed, because nothing verifies a committed copy against the policy
# sources, so a committed copy could go stale silently.
domain6-2c-policy-manifest.json
